dren\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"faster development\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"better automated tests\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"higher quality software\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"more fun, less grind\"}],\"\\n\"],\"className\":\"ah-bullets\"}]}]\n4a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Best of all, you'll free up time to focus on your highest-value work: planning, designing, and actual engineering.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n4b:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"So, how can \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"you\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" thread that needle between anxiety and over-excitement and build that confidence?\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n4c:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"not-prose mx-auto my-8 flex max-w-xl flex-col items-center gap-2.5 text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$Ld8\",null,{\"actionLabel\":\"Join Waitlist\",\"productName\":\"Claude Code for Real Engineers (Cohort 3)\",\"surface\":\"cohort-page\",\"knownIdentity\":false}],null]}]\n4d:[\"$\",\"hr\",null,{\"className\":\"ah-prose-hr\"}]\n4e:[\"$\",\"$L41\",null,{\"level\":2,\"children\":[\"First step: \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"Analyze\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" like an engineer\"]}]\n4f:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Production environments — especially existing codebases — require a \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"professional approach\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\".\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n50:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Fancy tools can't eliminate engineering. In fact, the better the tools get, the wider the gulf gets between vibe coders and real engineers.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n51:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":[\"A real engineer knows the real work of software development has never been \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"lines of code\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\".\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n52:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"They know that \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"engineering\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" happens in the brain, not the IDE.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n53:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"You, the engineer, have got to have a plan to prevent:\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n54:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Data loss\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" or destruction\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Non-compliance\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" with industry or corporate standards\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Breaking changes\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" subtle enough to escape notice until it's too late\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"Most existential of all: getting stuck in the mud as you \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"lose your \\\"sense\\\" for a codebase\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}]]}],\"\\n\"],\"className\":\"ah-bullets\"}]\n55:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"That last one should really be on ALL of our minds, because losing this sense isn't just an emotional reaction. It's a genuine cognitive loss that leads to a loss of understanding, team confusion, and the kind of overwhelm that does real (and possibly long term) damage to devs and their teams.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n56:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"These are high stakes, and the costs can be \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"staggering\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\".\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n57:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"But these problems aren't new problems, even though they're accelerated by new tools.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n58:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Software developers like you have faced these same challenges with every innovation: from scripting languages to GUIs to advanced web frameworks, from outsourcing to distributed computing.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n59:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"This is the legacy of engineering: our tools are always changing. And we're always adapting.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n5a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We can use these new tools to accelerate new solutions, too.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n5b:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"That's why \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"real engineering skills\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" matter, today, tomorrow, and forever.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n5c:[\"$\",\"hr\",null,{\"className\":\"ah-prose-hr\"}]\n5d:[\"$\",\"$L41\",null,{\"level\":2,\"children\":[\"Second step: \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"Think\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" like an engineer\"]}]\n5e:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"A real engineer knows their tools intimately: what a tool is good for, how and where it excels, where it fails or falters, and how it breaks.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n5f:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"And, as an engineer, you should know that while AI is a new and unusual tool… it's still a tool. One you must fit intentionally into your professional software development process.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n60:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"You can build the process that \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"makes\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" these tools trustworthy.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n61:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"These are the core engineering skills you'll need to get the most out of Claude Code, or any AI-coding assistant:\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n62:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Communicating\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\": clearly sharing your thoughts, ideas, observations, requirements\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Anticipating\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\": quickly identifying potential problems before they happen\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Planning:\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" reliably turning huge chunks of work into well-formatted PRDs\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Decomposing:\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" thoughtfully breaking down big plans into well-scoped, iterative tasks\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Delegating\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\": confidently knowing what \u0026 how to offload tasks\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Systematizing\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\": consistently building feedback loops that produce quality outputs (types, tests, \u0026 reviews)\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Parallelizing\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\": mindfully balancing quality assurance and coding, for maximum productivity\"]}],\"\\n\"],\"className\":\"ah-bullets\"}]\n63:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"These aren't new ideas. This \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"is\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" engineering.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n64:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"And I'll let you in on a little secret: these higher-order skills apply just as much to working effectively with people, not just coding agents.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n65:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Real engineering is the only way to generate safe, worthwhile, \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"long-lasting\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" code… by hand, or with AI tools.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n66:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"If you don't use these skills — or you don't \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"consistently\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" use these skills — in your dev process today, today is the day to learn how.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n67:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"And if you do use these skills today, writing code by hand, now's the time to learn how you can apply them with Claude Code.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n68:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":[\"The way you produce \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"lines of code\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" may change, but the core fundamentals of producing well-engineered \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"software\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" is eternal.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n69:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"Your\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" engineering skills make the difference between success and failure, enhanced productivity and technical debt at speed, safe code and code that risks everything.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n6a:[\"$\",\"hr\",null,{\"className\":\"ah-prose-hr\"}]\n6b:[\"$\",\"$L41\",null,{\"level\":2,\"children\":\"Now: Learn to use Claude Code like a real engineer\"}]\n6c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"When \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"you\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" practice real engineering, \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"you\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" unlock the power of Claude Code.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n6d:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"For example, I've always dreamed about building the perfect course creator, designed specifically for \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"my\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" personal course development process.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n6e:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"From keeping my ideas organized, to the actual recording and editing process. I just knew that the right piece of software could let me focus more on making the learning experience \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"amazing.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}]],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n6f:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"But this is my livelihood. It couldn't just be a vibe coded weekend project. I needed a reliable, professional grade tool, and knew that justifying that kind of time investment never made sense.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n70:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"So for multiple years, that tool remained a pipe dream, with many aborted attempts.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n71:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"But since I've started using Claude Code with Ralph loops, I've shipped over 1,000 commits, and created and closed over 500 of my own issues. Today, my professional-grade course creator includes things I never imagined possible:\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n72:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"a full in-browser video editor\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"AI writing assistant with 14 unique modes\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Dropbox/CMS/YouTube/X/LinkedIn sync\"}],\"\\n\"],\"className\":\"ah-bullets\"}]\n73:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"It’s all powered by TypeScript (obviously), and backed by the amazing Effect.ts library.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n74:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"And here's the kicker: I built everything in \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"my spare time\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\", while running my business \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"and enjoying\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" life as the loving dad of my 2-year old.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n75:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":