ke sure you understand, and bring questions to Office Hours!\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n8a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Here's what's you can look forward to, in detail:\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n8b:[\"$\",\"$L41\",null,{\"level\":3,\"children\":\"Pre-course: Getting to Know Claude Code\"}]\n8c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"To help you hit the ground running on Day 1, once you enroll you'll get immediate access to a collection of \\\"Getting to Know Claude Code\\\" lessons that I designed specifically for this course.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n8d:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"If you're brand new to Claude Code, this will help you get you comfortable with key terminology and features in the CLI coding assistant. And if you're already comfortable, this will be a useful and breezy refresher!\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n8e:[\"$\",\"$L37\",null,{\"src\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/total-typescript/image/upload/v1762947890/cohorts/cohort-ytorn/e8qoqfwxsp9zsqrzvfnl.png\",\"width\":737,\"height\":132,\"alt\":\"\",\"loading\":\"lazy\"}]\n8f:[\"$\",\"$L41\",null,{\"level\":3,\"children\":\"Week 1: Foundations, Steering \u0026 Planning\"}]\n90:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"This week, we will build your engineering toolkit for working with an AI coding agent.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n91:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"We'll start by making sure you understand the real constraints of LLMs, and how to manage them, all while using Claude Code to successfully build a new feature in a production-grade codebase.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n92:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"You'll learn how context windows work, why managing them carefully matters, and how subagents can help you keep your context window clean. We'll practice exploring large codebases and using the Plan/Execute/Clear loop.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n93:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Combined, all of these techniques help your coding assistant stay in the \\\"smart zone\\\" where it writes great code, and avoid the \\\"dumb zone\\\" that sends it in circles.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n94:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Then you'll learn to steer the coding assistant.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" You'll write an AGENTS.md file that doesn't waste tokens on unnecessary instructions, and instead teach your agent how to conform to your team's preferences and expertise using custom skills and progressive disclosure (all while preventing wasted tokens).\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n95:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"By the end of the first week, you'll be planning and building features like a senior engineer:\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n96:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"decomposing full-size features into context-window-sized chunks to build\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"writing PRDs with a purpose-built skill\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"using tracer bullets to validate architecture before committing to a full build\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"and executing multi-phase plans that ship features far bigger than any single agent session can handle\"}],\"\\n\"],\"className\":\"ah-bullets\"}]\n97:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"We'll wrap up Week 1 with Office Hours\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\". Bring your questions, get direct answers. Can't make it live? Submit your question in advance and get the recording and transcript.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n98:[\"$\",\"$L37\",null,{\"src\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/total-typescript/image/upload/v1762947890/cohorts/cohort-ytorn/qzrjvahpmekjz5cctzrh.png\",\"width\":737,\"height\":132,\"alt\":\"\",\"loading\":\"lazy\"}]\n99:[\"$\",\"$L41\",null,{\"level\":3,\"children\":\"Week 2: Feedback Loops, Autonomy \u0026 Real-World Patterns\"}]\n9a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Week 2 stacks on top of everything you learn in week 1, introducing systems that make AI-assisted software engineering both \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"trustworthy\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" and \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"reliable\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\".\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n9b:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"First, you'll find out why a green CI pipeline is non-negotiable when working with agents, and learning what kinds of tests do (and don't) belong in your agent's red-green-refactor workflow. You'll build a custom \\\"skill\\\" that encodes your team's quality bar into every task, and pre-commit hooks that add a deterministic safety net to your code quality!\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n9c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Then, the key to automating your engineering workflow: the \\\"Ralph Wiggum\\\" loop, a deceptively simple and incredibly powerful pattern for letting your agent autonomously build entire features into your app.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n9d:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"You'll learn and practice running Ralph in two modes: first, with \\\"human-in-the-loop\\\" mode (hint: you're that human). HITL gives you both visibility and control while you're learning.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n9e:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Then we'll take off the training wheels and set up a safe sandbox for Claude Code to operate entirely on its own (while you are AFK), pulling from a GitHub Issues backlog, prioritizing fixes and features, and committing changes to branches. With just a bit of practice, you'll have it churning through work while you focus on other things that matter most.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\n9f:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"By the end of week two, you'll have a clear sense of when to stay in the loop vs. go AFK autonomous, including:\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\na0:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"how and when to run research phases that save future sessions hours of work\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"the power of flexible kanban boards instead of upfront plans\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"and maybe most importantly, how to make sure that your codebase is prepared for AI agents to actually navigate it effectively.\"}],\"\\n\"],\"className\":\"ah-bullets\"}]\na1:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Week 2 Office Hours with Matt\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\". Same format, deeper questions. By now you'll have real experience to draw from, so we can help you connect the dots between your practice and real work in your codebase!\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\na2:[\"$\",\"$L37\",null,{\"src\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/total-typescript/image/upload/v1762947890/cohorts/cohort-ytorn/xagmuofo0mu7qtj6weeq.png\",\"width\":737,\"height\":132,\"alt\":\"\",\"loading\":\"lazy\"}]\na3:[\"$\",\"$L41\",null,{\"level\":3,\"children\":\"Your Future with Claude Code (and beyond) is Inside\"}]\na4:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"This course focuses on the Claude Code CLI, which is where I've honed these skills and gotten the best results myself. So it's the best way for me to teach you!\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\na5:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"But once you've practiced the skills here, you'll be able to use the same techniques and knowledge in just about \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"any\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-em\"}],\" CLI coding assistant, with virtually any frontier AI model.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\na6:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"And the more you practice these skills, the better judgement you'll bring to using coding assistants in production-grade codebases.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\na7:[\"$\",\"$L41\",null,{\"level\":3,\"children\":\"Learn on your schedule, from anywhere\"}]\na8:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Claude Code for Real Engineers is the most flexible course I've ever offered:\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\na9:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Instead of being yoked to a semi-daily schedule, you'll receive the entire weeks' worth of lessons each Monday, so you can work ahead or take it slow.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\naa:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"You'll gain access to 6 live Office Hours across 3 days — staggered for different time zones — to give you the most opportunity to get personal help directly from me. Ask ahead if you can't make it; recordings and transcripts are always included.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\nab:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"And, of course, you'll get invited to my private AI Hero Discord, with an exclusive channel for you to meet \u0026 learn along with your fellow attendees.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\nac:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"This way, you get the best of sync and async courses in one great experience.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\nad:[\"$\",\"$L37\",null,{\"src\":\"https://res.cloudinary.com/total-typescript/image/upload/v1762947890/cohorts/cohort-ytorn/r4cespl7dgsdkuw0v3cf.png\",\"width\":737,\"height\":132,\"alt\":\"\",\"loading\":\"lazy\"}]\nae:[\"$\",\"$L41\",null,{\"level\":2,\"children\":\"What's included\"}]\naf:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"For \",[\"$\",\"$L3d\",null,{\"type\":\"original\",\"pricingDataLoader\":\"$@3e\"}],\" you'll learn everything you need to call yourself a Real AI Engineer.\"],\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\nb0:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Here's what you get when you enroll:\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\nb1:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"All lessons and coding exercises\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\". Tight, snappy videos and hands-on practice in a safe sandbox environment. Yours to keep forever.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"The course code repo\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\". Clone it, reference it, build on it. It's yours.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Pre-class access\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\". Getting to Know Claude Code lessons available immediately upon enrollment so you're ready on Day 1.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Weekly Office Hours with Matt\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\". Live Q\u0026A sessions with me on Monday March 30, Friday April 3, and Weds April 8, with two time-zone friendly options. Submit questions in advance if you can't join live.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"All recordings and transcripts\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\". Every office hours session, captured and available for replay.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Exclusive Discord access\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\". Learn alongside your fellow students, ask questions, share wins, and soak up the energy of a group of smart folks figuring things out together.\"]}],\"\\n\"],\"className\":\"ah-bullets\"}]\nb2:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Everything listed here is yours to keep so you can revisit them any time as a reference, as a refresher, or to go deeper with exercises you didn't get to during the cohort.\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-p\"}]\nb3:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Enroll today\",\"className\":\"ah-prose-strong\"}],\" to gain the skills, workflows, and confidence to use AI coding tools the way they were meant to be used: as a force multipli